  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline Snapper is an octagonal co-polyester built around one core objective: maximizing snapback. Toroline increased the surface slickness to reduce inter-string friction and allow the string to slide and return rapidly after impact. Combined with its eight-sided profile, Snapper delivers strong spin, excellent directional control and a more penetrating ball flight while maintaining a softer response than many traditional shaped co-polys. It is available in Lavender at 1.23 mm / 17 gauge.",

    "zh": "Toroline Snapper 是一款以最大化 Snapback 为核心设计的八边形共聚酯球线。Toroline 通过进一步提高球线表面的光滑度来降低主横线之间的摩擦，让球线在击球后能够更快速地滑动和回位。八边形结构同时提供足够的球面抓力，因此 Snapper 能够兼顾高旋转、优秀方向控制以及更具穿透力的球路，并且整体反馈比许多传统异形聚酯更加柔和。产品规格为 1.23 毫米 / 17，颜色为 Lavender。"
  },

